{"unit_id":"kuangre123__dsh-context-press#readme-1","repo":"kuangre123/dsh-context-press","commit":"ff2db2d1a2acf15fe240decabb04b09a519301bf","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-press README · 上下文液压机：DeepSeek Harness 会话输入栏的压缩工具。点「液压机」打开面板，再触发当前会话的原生压缩。压缩期间可以切换会话，原请求仍只作用于发起时的会话。压缩前后用量来自 Harness 的上下文用量估算。\n\n<img width=\"1530\" height=\"944\" alt=\"5c1971ed790d6f6fe23221a4c9039db8\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/795cdd97-27b5-4cbc-83cd-565c02823bf5\" />","source":"extracted","section":"上下文液压机"}
{"unit_id":"kuangre123__dsh-context-press#readme-2","repo":"kuangre123/dsh-context-press","commit":"ff2db2d1a2acf15fe240decabb04b09a519301bf","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-press README · 安装：从 [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/kuangre123/dsh-context-press/releases/latest) 下载 `dsh-context-press-0.1.3.tgz`，使用 Harness 插件管理器添加该文件，或在 macOS 运行：\n\n```sh\n\"/Applications/DeepSeek Harness.app/Contents/Resources/runtime/cli/bin/dsh\" plugin --profile desktop add \"file:/绝对路径/dsh-context-press-0.1.3.tgz\"\n```\n\n重新启动 Harness 后，在已有会话的输入栏查看入口。移除时在插件管理器卸载，或用相同 CLI 执行 `plugin --profile desktop remove dsh-context-press`。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
